# Requirement Analysis Phase

## Project Name
Skill-wallet

## Functional Requirements

1. User registration and login.
2. User profile management.
3. Add skills.
4. View skills.
5. Update skills.
6. Delete skills.
7. Track skill-related information.
8. Store project data securely.

## Non-Functional Requirements

- User-friendly interface
- Good performance
- Data security
- Reliability
- Maintainability
- Easy navigation

## Hardware Requirements

- Computer or laptop
- Keyboard and mouse
- Internet connection

## Software Requirements

- Web browser
- Visual Studio Code
- Node.js
- Database
- GitHub

## Expected Outcome

The system should allow users to manage their skills easily through a simple web-based application.
